1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:13,260
Slide 3 lays out our "CORE MISSION & MOTTO: Soli Deo Gloria—Glory to God Alone." Notice the three foundational principles displayed across the screen.

2
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:19,229
Principle 1 is Our Mandate: Elevating human mind and spirit above mechanical work.

3
00:00:19,229 --> 00:00:25,141
Human beings were created with dignity, strategic discernment, empathy, and creative vision.

4
00:00:25,141 --> 00:00:32,660
We were never meant to spend 10 hours a day doing repetitive copy-paste tasks between spreadsheets and email inboxes.

5
00:00:33,360 --> 00:00:41,259
Principle 2 establishes Technology's Role: Technology is a tool to serve humans, not a master to control us.

6
00:00:41,259 --> 00:00:49,816
In our modern digital world, addictive notification algorithms and endless feeds constantly hijack our peace of mind.

7
00:00:49,816 --> 00:00:56,400
As Intelligence Architects, we must establish complete sovereignty over our digital tools.

8
00:00:57,100 --> 00:01:03,603
And Principle 3 is our Wisdom Goal: Automating simple tasks to save precious time for higher purpose.

9
00:01:03,603 --> 00:01:12,940
When our AI avatars handle routine administrative workflows, we reclaim precious hours to invest in our families, our faith, and serving society.

10
00:01:13,640 --> 00:01:18,500
Automation without wisdom leads to exhaustion and distraction.

11
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:24,379
But automation grounded in Soli Deo Gloria becomes sacred time stewardship.

12
00:01:24,379 --> 00:01:27,750
That is our north star at Oikos University.

